  "summary": "## Impact",
  "details": "## Impact\r\nA malicious user can use scripting commands to inject arbitrary information into the response stream for the given client, potentially corrupting or returning tampered data to other users on the same connection. \r\n\r\n## Details\r\nThe error handling code for lua scripts does not properly handle null characters.\r\n\r\n## Mitigation\r\nNo additional mitigations are provided.\r\n\r\n## Credits\r\nThe problem was reported by https://github.com/jylab.\r\n",
